edgeR 4.10.5 
BH in topTags equals p.adjust over all 500 genes: TRUE 
topTags(n=20) after topTags(p.value=0.05): rows ordered by PValue then |logFC| desc: TRUE 
single gene, FDR exactly 0.05: topTags(p.value=0.05) returns 1 row(s); decideTests(p.value=0.05) calls it 0 (1 = Up, 0 = NotSig)
decideTests(lfc=1) on logFC 0.9/1.1/-1.1 with p=1e-6: 0 1 -1 
topTags(sort.by='logFC') on a 2-df test: Two or more logFC columns in DGELRT object. First logFC column used to rank by logFC. 
columns of a 2-df glmQLFTest table: logFC.d.samples.group2, logFC.d.samples.group3, logCPM, F, PValue 
